{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":531,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Pumpkin_Bomb"},"children":["Pumpkin Bomb"]},"\n"]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwBg"},"children":["\n\n\n"]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCA"},"children":["\n\n"]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwCg"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Wiki media omitted"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"dl","props":{},"children":[{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["A Pumpkin Bomb possessed with either a helpful or mischievous spirit. Applies either a buff or debuff to enemies."]},{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["―"]},"In-Game Description"]}]}]},"\n"]},"\n","\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwDA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Pumpkin Bomb"]}," is an event consumable that can be obtained from the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Hexscape_Event","title":"Hexscape Event"},"children":["Hexscape Event"]}," and the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Null_&_Void_Event","title":"Null & Void Event"},"children":["Null & Void Event"]},". It can be used to support towers by debuffing enemies or support the enemies by buffing them. It can be obtained from the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Low_Grade_Crate","title":"Low Grade Crate"},"children":["Low Grade Crate"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Mid_Grade_Crate","title":"Mid Grade Crate"},"children":["Mid Grade Crate"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/High_Grade_Crate","title":"High Grade Crate"},"children":["High Grade Crate"]}," or mode triumphs."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Pumpkin Bomb"]}," can be used five times by a player in a single match. It has a 5 second cooldown, but when the match starts, it is set to 10."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwFg"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Usage"},"children":["Usage"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["When using the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Pumpkin Bomb"]},", the player's avatar holds a pumpkin, playing custom animation; you will be able to select an area where it can be thrown. All enemies hit in its 6 explosion range explosion will have a buff or a debuff applied to them. There is a 40% chance the enemies will receive a buff and a 60% the enemies will receive a debuff. Additionally, all enemies will receive 120 damage if they get debuffed. No damage will be dealt to them if it is they receive a buff. Its explosion, if it deals damage, does not bypass defense and it can damage ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Lead_(Attribute)","title":"Lead (Attribute)"},"children":["Lead"]}," enemies."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["There are three possible buffs that can be applied to enemies:"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Enemies can receive the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Bloated","title":"Bloated"},"children":["Bloated"]}," attribute, doubling their current and maximum health."]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Enemies can receive the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nimble","title":"Nimble"},"children":["Nimble"]}," attribute, doubling their speed."]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Enemies can receive the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Health_Regen","title":"Health Regen"},"children":["Health Regen"]}," attribute, making them regenerate 2% of their maximum health every 2 seconds."]}]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["There are three possible debuffs that can be applied, with all of them also dealing 120 damage to enemies:"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Enemies will be frozen for 2 seconds and have their defense reduced by 20%. Defense dropping is the same as freeze defense dropping."]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Enemies will have the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Hidden_(Attribute)","title":"Hidden (Attribute)"},"children":["Hidden"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Aggro","title":"Aggro"},"children":["Aggro"]}," attributes removed from them.\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["During the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Operation_I.C.E_Event","title":"Operation I.C.E Event"},"children":["Operation I.C.E Event"]},", when applied to a ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Siege_Engine","title":"Siege Engine"},"children":["Siege Engine"]},", it would gain 50,000 health, and the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Full_Immunity","title":"Full Immunity"},"children":["God"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/No_Target","title":"No Target"},"children":["No Target"]}," attributes would be removed."]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Enemies will receive the three bleed debuff stacks with 0.375 EV (exponential value), 2 base bleed damage and 10 max stacks.",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[]}]}]},{"type":"table","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"tbody","props":{},"children":[{"type":"tr","props":{},"children":[{"type":"th","props":{"colSpan":3},"children":["Bleed Damage"]}]},"\n",{"type":"tr","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"th","props":{},"children":["Health"]},{"type":"th","props":{},"children":["Tick Damage"]},{"type":"th","props":{},"children":["Collapse Damage"]}]},"\n",{"type":"tr","props":{},"c